msgid ""
"You just pressed the Shift key 5 times in a row.  This is the shortcut for "
"the Sticky Keys feature, which affects the way your keyboard works."
msgstr ""
"Tu justo ha pressate le clave Shift pro 5 vices in un riga.  Isto is le via-"
"breve pro le function Claves permanente, que affice le maniera tu claviero "
"labora."

